WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.558
You do not need to wait for a governance decision to participate. Start with the public songbook, chords, stories, and open rider. Two songs named in this deck are Butterflies and Love, using G, E minor, C and D, and A Planet We Share As One, using C, G and D. Play them in your own way, contribute code or translation, help with sound, make a careful public record, or simply listen. The join page says open jams are permissionless; an application is for curated slots, rider coordination, travel help, and getting acquainted. No audition, follower count, fame, or professional title is the price of belonging. Existing open recordings remain separate from any raw meeting recording. No synthesized music or participant performance is hiding under this narration.
